stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    state "NEW 待分派" as NEW
    state "ASSIGNED 待处理" as ASSIGNED
    state "IN_PROGRESS 处理中" as IN_PROGRESS
    state "CLOSED 已关闭" as CLOSED
    [*] --> NEW: 创建时无有效责任人
    [*] --> ASSIGNED: 创建时有有效责任人
    NEW --> ASSIGNED: 管理员分派
    ASSIGNED --> ASSIGNED: 管理员重新分派
    ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS: 有权处理者开始
    IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS: 追加处置记录
    IN_PROGRESS --> ASSIGNED: 管理员重新分派
    IN_PROGRESS --> CLOSED: 全部关闭门槛满足
    note right of IN_PROGRESS
        来源状态另存
        来源恢复不自动关闭
    end note
    note right of CLOSED
        禁止后续修改
        也不允许重复恢复
    end note
